          <div class="producto-card-img" style="background-image: url(/images/productos-escolares/esc-06/esc-06-01.jpg); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
          <div class="producto-card-info">
            <span class="producto-card-cat">Aula Modular</span>
            <h3>Mobiliario Escolar Modular Reconfigurable con Ruedas</h3>
